<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - The North Face started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - The North Face started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said analyst Diane Daggatt initiated coverage of North Face Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month target of $28 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 13/16 to 19-5/8.</p>
